:PATH
Section 3 Supervision of Financial Intermediaries under Article 2 paragraph 2
|

:NOTE
Amended by Annex No 17 of the Financial Market Supervision Act of 22 June 2007, in force since 1 Jan. 2009 (AS 2008 5207; BBl 2006 2829).
