Art. 20 Activity without affiliation to a self-regulatory organisation
1 FINMA may take supervisory action in accordance with Articles 29 to 37 of the FINMASA against financial intermediaries who fail to comply with the duty to be affiliated to a recognised self-regulatory organisation in accordance with Article 14 paragraph 1.
2 It may order the liquidation of legal entities and general and limited partnerships, and the deletion of sole proprietorships from the commercial register.
|

